'''Demitrius Bronson''' (born March 6, 1990) is an American professional wrestler and retired [[American football]] running back of the [[National Football League]]. During his time in the NFL, Bronson was a member of the [[Seattle Seahawks]] and [[Miami Dolphins]]. He was signed with [[WWE]] under their developmental brand [[NXT (WWE brand)|NXT]].
